<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:50:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stock Futures Plunge as Renewed AI Worries Fuels Tech Losses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于数据中心的繁荣导致供应紧张，美国钢铁买家转向海外</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-steel-buyers-turn-abroad-as-data-center-boom-strains-supply</link><description>尽管华盛顿征收关税，但由于数据中心建设热潮挤压了国内供应并推高了价格，较便宜的亚洲进口产品正在吸引美国钢铁买家。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-steel-buyers-turn-abroad-as-data-center-boom-strains-supply'&gt;由于数据中心的繁荣导致供应紧张，美国钢铁买家转向海外&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Steel Buyers Turn Abroad as Data Center Boom Strains Supply&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-steel-buyers-turn-abroad-as-data-center-boom-strains-supply</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:12:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>欧洲天然气交易商将迎来动荡的冬天</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/europe-s-gas-traders-are-in-for-a-volatile-winter</link><description>非洲大陆微薄的供应缓冲，加上不断变化的天气预报和中东战争，将继续冲击市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/europe-s-gas-traders-are-in-for-a-volatile-winter'&gt;欧洲天然气交易商将迎来动荡的冬天&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Europe’s Gas Traders Are in for a Volatile Winter&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/europe-s-gas-traders-are-in-for-a-volatile-winter</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:24:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>PCE 之前科技股抛售持续加剧；美国准备加征关税</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-brief-11-25-2026-video</link><description>由于对人工智能交易前景的质疑增多，美国股指期货下跌，而美国国债在最新个人消费支出数据公布前上涨。中国称美国对其出口产品征收新关税的前景是“政治操纵”，并敦促双方维持贸易休战。汇丰银行 (HSBC) 的马克斯·凯特纳 (Max Kettner) 加入《彭博简报》讨论科技股抛售，并展望通胀数据。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-brief-11-25-2026-video'&gt;PCE 之前科技股抛售持续加剧；美国准备加征关税&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Tech Selloff Pesists Ahead of PCE; US Prepares Tariff Hikes&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-brief-11-25-2026-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:28:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Swoon as AI Fears Spur Rush to Treasuries: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>